.TH CLIENT 1 "September 2026" "Version 0.4.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test driver for the myutils string and file utility library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is the demonstration/test executable for the myutils project. It exercises
each of the custom string functions (
.BR mystrlen ", " mystrcpy ", " mystrncpy ", " mystrcat )
and file functions (
.BR wordCount ", " mygrep )
implemented in the myutils library, printing the result of each test to
standard output.
.PP
No command-line arguments are required or accepted; the program runs a
fixed internal test sequence.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B client
returns 0 on successful completion, and a non-zero value if a file
operation used during testing fails.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mystrlen (3),
.BR mystrcpy (3),
.BR mystrncpy (3),
.BR mystrcat (3),
.BR wordCount (3),
.BR mygrep (3)
